Package: seor
Type: Package
Title: Easily Install and Load the 'seor' SEO and Developer Tools
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Bart", "Turczynski", , "bartek@turczynski.pl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The 'seor' suite bundles a set of focused R packages for search
    engine optimization and web-developer workflows: URL parsing, punycode and
    internationalized-domain conversion, public suffix list lookups, XML
    sitemap parsing and PageRank estimation. Loading 'seor' with a single call
    to library() installs and attaches all of the member packages at once, in
    the style of the 'tidyverse' metapackage.
URL: https://seor-272402.gitlab.io,
    https://gitlab.com/bart-turczynski/seor
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
